{"type": "provenance", "schema": "gw2-frida-token-at-fire-sample/1", "what": "what the sampler really eats: at `calculate_function` (x86 RVA 0x3c2530) entry we dump the token list `&Vec<Token>` (16 B/token) it is handed, the caller, x0/y0/step/flip/mode, and we dump every `MathFunction::new` (0x4ed670) call (input text bytes -> token list) so the token list can be traced to the exact text it was parsed from. Compared byte-for-byte with the two text representations a replay records (`FunctionInfo.function` / `FunctionInfo.corrected_function`).", "build": {"game": "Graphwar II Linux 2.0.60 (Steam)", "libgraphwarrust.so_sha256": "9a53811518e74b7575c1b9dd1f21cdd1f4f015bfdcd8eaeee4dfdf0bcabed187", "engine": "Godot 4.7.stable.official.5b4e0cb0f + godot-rust (API v4.6, runtime v4.7)", "address_space": "RVA = ELF virtual address = module offset; Ghidra address = RVA + 0x100000", "hooked_rva": {"calculate_function": "0x3c2530", "math_function_new_0x4ed670": "0x4ed670", "calculate_function_offset_str": "0x3c5f70"}, "token_layout": "Vec<Token>{cap@+0, ptr@+8, len@+0x10}; Token = {tag: u64, value: f64} = 16 B", "abi": "calculate_function(sret:rdi, tokens:rsi, flip:edx, mode:ecx, x0:xmm0, y0:xmm1, step:xmm2); MathFunction::new(sret:rdi, text:&String rsi)"}, "how": {"harness": "Xvfb :97 -screen 0 1920x1160x24 -listen tcp -ac  (+ mesa-only EGL/GLX env)", "driver": "tools/frida_point_array.py --attach --tokens  (NOT frida spawn: spawn hangs this build in wait4 before it creates a window; see docs/06 42.1)", "flow": "Popen game -> attach -> Campaign / level node / Start -> type f(x) -> LONG-PRESS Fire!", "correlation": "the sampler hook compares its token list against every parse in a 256-entry ring by (a) pointer identity of the token buffer and (b) 16 B/token byte equality"}, "cut": "per calculate_function call: caller, flip/mode, x0/y0/step bit patterns, the token list (hex of 16*len bytes + tags), and the parse record it matches (caller + input text + text hex). Replay side: only the FunctionInfo row whose corrected_function is byte-identical to the captured text (no guessing), plus the shot-shaping rows (FunctionPoints / EffectInfo).", "dropped": "beat heartbeats, evals/samplers bulk rows, the raw gzip replay bytes, screenshots.", "no_local_paths": "this file contains no filesystem path and no user name; pointers are ASLR-random per run.", "sources": [{"label": "series1", "raw_jsonl_sha256": "0934fbeef78e58339b21bd8b3601182e7f4fbc117ac381842bcd033ff2db17fe", "raw_jsonl_lines": 397, "records_by_type": {"cfg_ack": 1, "selftest": 1, "hooks": 1, "beat": 175, "tok_parse": 146, "tok_suffix": 48, "tok_fire": 4, "reallocs": 7, "calc_array": 4, "samplers": 4, "exec_enter": 2, "exec_queue": 2, "pos_read": 2}, "fires": 4}, {"label": "series2", "raw_jsonl_sha256": "6ad11a39a3606da5b12a81d3e7b9f304a9da4369fcd20210b9cb9da10d1725ca", "raw_jsonl_lines": 148, "records_by_type": {"cfg_ack": 1, "selftest": 1, "hooks": 1, "beat": 38, "tok_parse": 62, "tok_suffix": 20, "tok_fire": 4, "reallocs": 7, "calc_array": 4, "samplers": 4, "exec_enter": 2, "exec_queue": 2, "pos_read": 2}, "fires": 4}], "replay": {"sha256": "5cfb29c189ea2adf8fc6a183de9cf58cfee585d8605c94f55864f786c8822f24", "function_info_rows": 49, "excerpt": [{"tick": 1, "event": {"GameStateInfo": {"game_state": "Connecting"}}}, {"tick": 2, "event": {"GameStateInfo": {"game_state": "Setup"}}}, {"tick": 6, "event": {"TargetInfo": {"target_id": 232}}}, {"tick": 6, "event": {"LifeInfo": {"entity_id": 230, "alive": true}}}, {"tick": 6, "event": {"LifeInfo": {"entity_id": 232, "alive": true}}}, {"tick": 6, "event": {"GameStateInfo": {"game_state": "WaitingForFunctions"}}}, {"tick": 6, "event": {"TargetInfo": {"target_id": 232}}}, {"tick": 6, "event": {"LifeInfo": {"entity_id": 230, "alive": true}}}, {"tick": 6, "event": {"LifeInfo": {"entity_id": 232, "alive": true}}}, {"tick": 5975, "event": {"FunctionFire": {"soldier_id": 230}}}, {"tick": 5975, "event": {"GameStateInfo": {"game_state": "CalculatingResult